{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 的输入起点是 n×J 的归一化表达矩阵，因此 normalized_expression=present 满足其基本输入条件。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "We start from an n×J matrix of normalized expression measures (e.g., read counts) for n single cells and J genes or features."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "降维是强烈推荐的条件，但并非必需；归一化表达也可以直接使用，不构成固定的 PCA 依赖。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Dimensionality reduction is strongly recommended, while the text explicitly allows direct use of normalized expression. It is not REQUIRED or a fixed PCA dependency."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "已知的末端簇是可选的局部监督信息，不会固定所有谱系的数量。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "Known terminal clusters provide optional local supervision; they do not fix the number of all lineages."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 能够推断分支细胞谱系，并可为每个谱系分配 pseudotime。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "Slingshot infers branching cellular lineages."
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "Slingshot assigns per-lineage pseudotime to cells."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：论文版本要求用户指定初始簇或根节点，这是该版本特有的说明，不代表所有软件版本都必须显式传入 root 参数。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "Slingshot requires the user to identify the initial cluster or root node."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：包描述中“在降维和聚类之后作为分析流程组件”只是流程位置说明，不能当作精确的通用硬性输入门槛。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "Slingshot was designed to model developmental trajectories in single-cell RNA sequencing data and serve as a component in an analysis pipeline after dimensionality reduction and clustering."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
